{"3108570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ENTWINE", "steam_appid": 3108570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">&quot;At the end of my life, I find the devil&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A FIRST PERSON PSYCHOLOGICAL HORROR VIDEOGAME.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108570/extras/2e4abcdffd6dff705dd4f7aceb8e6515.avif?t=1786539766\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108570/extras_big/2e4abcdffd6dff705dd4f7aceb8e6515.avif?t=1786539766 width=1560 height=366 /></span>ENTWINE is a slow, suffocating surrender to the abstract: disturbingly real environments, human-like forms twisted into the unnatural, intricate interconnected puzzles, a deeply personal narrative, and slow-burn psychological horror inspired by the genre's most enduring classics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Lucas Raines, a retired police officer marked by a life he tried so desperately to escape. Hollowed, he is forced back into the Anderson Estate, and everything buried within it.       </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108570/extras/15243b3ad1e229884953ab8f07080b7d.avif?t=1786539766\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are defenceless; left with no traditional weapons, bar the environment, and the few items you have to maintain your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Solve interconnected puzzles and navigate shifting locations, from a decaying house and what lies beneath it, to a forgotten police station as the truth begins to surface, and something that knows you is drawing near.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108570/extras/757c0f8109165eaef87e3acdada0805c.avif?t=1786539766\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108570/extras_big/757c0f8109165eaef87e3acdada0805c.avif?t=1786539766 width=1560 height=608 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deeply atmospheric, hand-crafted environments grounded in realism</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Binaural audio powered by Steam Audio for immersive spatial sound</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied locations. Explore a forest, abandoned house, police station and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure isolation, no NPCs, no hand-holding, nothing to rely on but your own judgment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative woven through exploration, environment, and discovery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intricate, multi-layered puzzles that require observation and interpretation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Native controller / gamepad support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108570/extras/de10ced06213330cd4630afb05df8eb0.poster.avif?t=1786539766\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108570/extras/de10ced06213330cd4630afb05df8eb0.webm?t=1786539766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108570/extras/de10ced06213330cd4630afb05df8eb0.mp4?t=1786539766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the