8570/extras/757c0f8109165eaef87e3acdada0805c.avif?t=1786539766\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108570/extras_big/757c0f8109165eaef87e3acdada0805c.avif?t=1786539766 width=1560 height=608 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deeply atmospheric, hand-crafted environments grounded in realism</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Binaural audio powered by Steam Audio for immersive spatial sound</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied locations. Explore a forest, abandoned house, police station and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure isolation, no NPCs, no hand-holding, nothing to rely on but your own judgment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative woven through exploration, environment, and discovery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intricate, multi-layered puzzles that require observation and interpretation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Native controller / gamepad support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108570/extras/de10ced06213330cd4630afb05df8eb0.poster.avif?t=1786539766\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108570/extras/de10ced06213330cd4630afb05df8eb0.webm?t=1786539766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108570/extras/de10ced06213330cd4630afb05df8eb0.mp4?t=1786539766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "A first-person psychological horror videogame. In St. Agnes’ Forest lay the death of Man, and inside, a tortured mind. Explore disturbingly real environments and solve i